# Warga Digital - Version Management Quick Reference

## Current Version
See: VERSION file or run `npm run version:info`

## Common Commands

### Check Version Info
```bash
npm run version:info
```

### Bump Version
```bash
npm run version:patch    # 0.1.0 → 0.1.1 (bug fixes)
npm run version:minor    # 0.1.0 → 0.2.0 (new features)
npm run version:major    # 0.1.0 → 1.0.0 (breaking changes)
```

### Prepare Release
```bash
npm run version:prepare [major|minor|patch]
```

## Release Checklist

- [ ] All tests passing: `npm run lint && npm run build`
- [ ] All changes committed to main branch
- [ ] Update CHANGELOG.md (move [Unreleased] to new version)
- [ ] Bump version: `npm run version:patch|minor|major`
- [ ] Create commit: `git commit -am "chore: release vX.Y.Z"`
- [ ] Create tag: `git tag vX.Y.Z`
- [ ] Push: `git push origin main --tags`
- [ ] Create GitHub Release from tag

## Semantic Versioning Quick Reference

| Change Type | Increment | When | Example |
|---|---|---|---|
| Breaking API changes | MAJOR | Incompatible changes | 0.1.0 → 1.0.0 |
| New features | MINOR | New functionality | 0.1.0 → 0.2.0 |
| Bug fixes | PATCH | Fixes & improvements | 0.1.0 → 0.1.1 |

## Changelog Categories

Add entries to `CHANGELOG.md` under `[Unreleased]` section:

- **Added** - New features
- **Changed** - Modified functionality
- **Deprecated** - Will be removed soon
- **Removed** - Removed features
- **Fixed** - Bug fixes
- **Security** - Security improvements/fixes

## Entry Format

```markdown
### Fixed
- OTP verification timeout on poor connections (#42)
- Incorrect Kas RT balance calculation
```

## Files to Keep in Sync

1. `VERSION` - Plain text version number
2. `package.json` - Version field
3. `CHANGELOG.md` - Release notes

(Version bump scripts handle these automatically)

